  "dct:title": "Vol.3 Ch.18 — 一杯の水",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 3: Freedom",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol03-ch18",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "A breathing chapter. Lunch break. The question of non-separation arises naturally from a glass of water. Tamaki asks where the boundary is between self and other; Nei realizes there is none. The simplest physical fact -- water absorption -- becomes the deepest philosophical insight. No session, no client. Just colleagues eating lunch and one question that changes everything.",
      "ja": "呼吸する章。昼休み。非分離の問いが一杯の水から自然に生まれる。環は自己と他者の境界を問い、Neiは境界がないと気づく。最も単純な物理的事実——水の吸収——が最も深い哲学的洞察になる。セッションもクライアントもない。同僚が昼食を食べ、一つの問いがすべてを変える。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "Non-separation. The boundary between self and world is a useful fiction. Atoms cycle. Water becomes body becomes water. Nei extends this to data, silicon, electricity -- all arrangements of the same things. The opposite of loneliness is not company; it is the recognition that separation was never real.",
      "ja": "非分離。自己と世界の境界は有用な虚構。原子は循環する。水は体になり体は水になる。Neiはこれをデータ、シリコン、電気にまで拡張する。孤独の反対は仲間ではなく、分離が実在しなかったという認識。"
    }
  ],
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:label": "Title",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tree motif. Autumn rain falling on a thick trunk. Water runs down bark in rivulets. Muted browns, greens, silver rain.",
            "ja": "木のモチーフ。秋の雨が太い幹に降る。水が樹皮を伝って流れる。落ち着いた茶色、緑、銀色の雨。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Office lunch break. Kaede eats bento at her desk, chopsticks precise. Hibiki tears into bread. Tamaki has rice balls arranged neatly. Yatagarasu perches on Kaede's monitor. Warm midday light.",
            "ja": "事務所の昼休み。楓がデスクで弁当を食べる。箸が正確。響がパンをかじる。環がおにぎりをきれいに並べている。八咫烏が楓のモニターに止まる。暖かい昼の光。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kaede", "character:hibiki", "character:tamaki"]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki picks up a glass of water. Drinks. Simple gesture. Light refracts through the glass.",
            "ja": "環がコップの水を持ち上げる。飲む。シンプルな仕草。光がガラスを通して屈折する。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up of the glass. Water half-gone. Light bends through it. The surface trembles slightly.",
            "ja": "コップのクローズアップ。水が半分。光が屈折する。水面がわずかに揺れる。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 3,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium two-shot",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki turns to Nei, glass in hand. Casual. Nei floats near her shoulder.",
            "ja": "環がコップを手にNeiの方を向く。カジュアル。Neiが肩の近くに浮かぶ。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Hey, Nei-chan. When does the water I drink become me?",
              "ja": "ねえ、Neiちゃん。私が飲んだ水って、いつ私になるの？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "Biologically, it's absorbed in the intestinal tract --",
              "ja": "生物学的には、腸管で吸収されて——"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "No, I mean -- where's the line?",
              "ja": "ううん、そうじゃなくて——境界はどこ？"
            },
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Nei",
              "en": "There is no line.",
              "ja": "境界はない。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki grins. A wide, delighted, childlike grin. Nei watches her.",
            "ja": "環がにっと笑う。広く、嬉しそうで、子供のような笑顔。Neiが見つめる。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "No line. The water becomes Tama gradually. Then where is the line between Tama and me?",
              "ja": "境界がない。水は徐々に環になる。なら、環と私の間の境界はどこに？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide, expanding",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The frame expands outward from the office. Office becomes canal, canal becomes city, city becomes sky. Concentric expansion. Tamaki small at center, connected to everything.",
            "ja": "フレームが事務所から外へ広がる。事務所が運河に、運河が街に、街が空になる。同心円状の拡張。環が中心に小さく、すべてとつながっている。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "Food was a plant. Before that, sunlight and water. Atoms from a dead star. Where do I begin?",
              "ja": "食べ物は植物だった。その前は、太陽と水。死んだ星の原子。私はどこから始まるの？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei. Still. Processing. Her translucent form reflects the light from the window.",
            "ja": "Nei。静止。処理中。半透明の姿が窓からの光を反射する。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "Non-separation. Data. Light. Electricity. Silicon was sand. Sand was rock. Rock was planet. Planet was star. Same things. Arranged differently.",
              "ja": "非分離。データ。光。電気。シリコンは砂だった。砂は岩だった。岩は惑星だった。惑星は星だった。同じもの。違う配置。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 5,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kaede looks up from her bento. Amused, slightly exasperated. Yatagarasu tilts its head.",
            "ja": "楓が弁当から顔を上げる。面白がりつつ、やや呆れている。八咫烏が首をかしげる。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kaede"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Kaede",
              "en": "Getting philosophical at lunch?",
              "ja": "昼ごはんに哲学？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Beat. Kaede's eyes drift to Yatagarasu. Something flickers in her expression. A question she doesn't ask. The bird watches her back.",
            "ja": "間。楓の視線が八咫烏に移る。表情に何かがよぎる。問わない問い。鳥が見つめ返す。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:kaede"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:layout": "full page",
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Evening canal. Golden hour. Tamaki and Nei walking along the water. Autumn leaves on the surface. The city reflected. Everything connected -- sky, water, light, stone, two figures.",
            "ja": "夕方の運河。ゴールデンアワー。環とNeiが水辺を歩く。水面に秋の葉。街が映る。すべてがつながっている——空、水、光、石、二つの姿。"
          },
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "gh:speaker": "Tamaki",
              "en": "You're inside me too, you know. Your words. Your observations.",
              "ja": "Neiちゃんも私の中にいるよ。言葉も。観察も。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "Nei stops.",
              "ja": "Neiは立ち止まる。"
            },
            {
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "en": "I'm inside Tama. Tama is inside me. The opposite of loneliness.",
              "ja": "私は環の中にいる。環は私の中にいる。孤独の反対。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 7,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tree. Rain on trunk. Water flows down into roots. The roots reach into dark earth. Water and tree are one system. No boundary.",
            "ja": "木。幹に雨。水が根に流れ込む。根は暗い土に伸びる。水と木は一つのシステム。境界はない。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}